{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "5c2791d7093207feb8a5a449f8f8aad351f0d44835389594dd0b9f8814387d18", "ja": "ア～イ！　地獄のラッピン", "zh": "Aight！地狱说唱", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ea69eb20a6aef8f42936f99caccd298b5e06e1d95ea420a962cf7d635d3c48fd", "ja": "ついに始まったラップの特訓。試行錯誤しな\nがら言葉を重ねていく律子たち。ロコと歩も\nオープニングアクトに向けて準備中。それぞ\nれがそれぞれの課題を見つけ、こなしていく\nのだった。", "zh": "拉普特训终于开始了。律子她们一边摸索，\n一边不断斟酌着词句。ROCO和步也\n在为开场表演做准备。她们各自\n找到了自己的课题，并逐一完成，\n就这样继续了下去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e99bf40ed24cf66b6fdeab54b376443bb1918ded88a0cc6be21036eb15e5bfe6", "ja": "（まずは、律子が用意した大量の音源や動画を皆で\n確認……そしていよいよ、レッスンが始まった！）", "zh": "（首先大家一起确认了律子准备的大量音源和视频……然后终于，训练开始了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_03_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "c90af2f8c368e778b39bb5e7cf370f9b0976bdc74e06004e8dc9f7b46dd77c84", "ja": "ノリはみんなわかってきたし、あとはとにかく\n数をこなして慣れるしかありませんね。", "zh": "大家已经逐渐掌握节奏了，接下来只能多练习、习惯起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_03_1002_011ami", "source_sha256": "957f2657603574a284fc0598777ea6d0d8f1aef968ea2b65ef72e302940d721f", "ja": "ラップ対決では、うまく相手の弱点を突く事も\n大事だかんね。それじゃ兄ちゃん、始めるよ！", "zh": "说唱对决中，巧妙地攻击对手的弱点也很重要哦。所以哥哥，要开始啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_03_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "c549884900abf83b08c11f494cb5aff6b0a84c1061485674c3a97ec681ecf1b7", "ja": "先行は……私ね。行くわよ、亜美！", "zh": "我先来……该我了。上吧，亚美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_03_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "a04c62dec2cb2f68e07bec5ab0ccf7a08ae39b8b61a059d069bce7ee2c0c5fb5", "ja": "地獄の特訓　シゴくぜラッピン！\nレペゼン劇場　爆音でいく　全力でカマセ！", "zh": "地狱特训　狠狠操练说唱！\n代表剧场　爆音开炸　全力接招吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_03_1005_011ami", "source_sha256": "c992a38e5393333a5cc3c8e735f9e724e61fc7ec1908a46d8278aceb5e8d8e73", "ja": "鬼軍曹　恐れるツインズ　だが挑むぞ全力　\nそれが双子のプライド　アーイ？", "zh": "鬼军曹　双子虽害怕　但也要全力挑战\n这就是双子的自尊　对不对？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_03_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "1a084d70dbdb4e6e9bc2792207bf85d4fb4dcd0d105e6e3abc892c79770c1b84", "ja": "鬼軍曹？　とか言っちゃったりするお前の頭が\nコンチクショウ！　アンサー返せよ　メーン？", "zh": "你这脑袋，居然还会说什么“鬼军曹？”，真是个混账！回答我啊，老兄？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_03_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c6c1c0702575723ada0d14effaf335b6cc36af0d0f8f33a239ed8a5f03af07ed", "ja": "（ん……？　リズム感はいいけど、\nふたりとも言葉がちょっと荒っぽいな……）", "zh": "（嗯……？　虽然节奏感不错，\n但两个人说话都有点粗鲁啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_03_1008_012mam", "source_sha256": "a1a6bff18f4f48d692754003e18174c787dcd12a91f994638085a369e8c7c82f", "ja": "次は、真美と律っちゃんだね！　いっくぞ～！", "zh": "接下来是真美和律姐！要上啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_03_1009_012mam", "source_sha256": "42642b1849f5b00eda833c5a0a1e03a4da4591e03f1265ef551d0f4f9cb0313a", "ja": "イタズラすると威圧感　秒で逃げ込む地下空間\n顔面蒼白　まるで脅迫　怒らないで律っちゃん！", "zh": "恶作剧就会散发压迫感　转眼间逃进地下空间\n脸色苍白　简直像被威胁　律子姐你别生气！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_03_1010_009rit", "source_sha256": "0d9225dcf8f2ad2c7af8ed677fba3fd11a853672cd4112afbaa85ba1e6d538f1", "ja": "こらー！　また何か隠してる　確信してる\n見せてみなさい　そしたら許す　……かもね？", "zh": "喂——！你肯定又藏了什么东西，我很确定。给我看看，那样我就原谅你……也许吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_03_1011_012mam", "source_sha256": "c94cbcbe6519aa967b30f6878131f42e47f9f23acd95540046576024df837d02", "ja": "ヒィッ！　えっと、えっと……！\n亜美～たすけて！", "zh": "呜哇！那个、那个……！\n亚美——救命啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_03_1012_009rit", "source_sha256": "224db4f9b7a169a2b24f2c76fa4e9952b472634a17fd1a022e59998c9d5e8059", "ja": "猛攻参加　もう降参か？\n言ってごらんよ　Say 白状", "zh": "参与猛攻，已经投降了吗？\n说出来让我听听，Say，老实交代！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_03_1013_011ami", "source_sha256": "3fe0af43a67010f344da415de938bae46afa34f42d87a9b5e5bcd390e342be8d", "ja": "待て待て律っちゃん　これは練習　まだ演習\nお互いニワカの　付け焼刃　……マジになるなよ？", "zh": "等等等等律子　这只是练习　还在演练\n咱俩都是半吊子　临阵磨枪　……可别当真哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_03_1014_009rit", "source_sha256": "d884768eccf2246749a6b15176f9377176b165e0477f075127050b90cc29c6a1", "ja": "わかったOK　言い訳は聞く　見慣れない風\nただならない脳　……ん？　私なに言ってるんだろ？", "zh": "知道了，OK。你的借口我听着。陌生的风，非同寻常的大脑……嗯？我到底在说什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_03_1018_p", "source_sha256": "9223b1dfd5bcb2438d7e3f6e59dc3b21eeb573a2b441cf6624c3b25b2810df6e", "ja": "完全に止まっちゃったみたいだな……。\n3人とも、ちょっと休憩しようか。", "zh": "看来彻底停下来了啊……\n你们3个，稍微休息一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_03_1019_009rit", "source_sha256": "f4350727d894300e1255ba6fe5cb2d88e7aa016aed89244609c25113b2381920", "ja": "うーん。なんかうまくいかないな。\n軽くサイファーする程度のつもりだったのに。", "zh": "嗯……总觉得不太顺利啊。\n本来只是想随便来段即兴说唱的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_03_1020_009rit", "source_sha256": "2578a187009bc8782edffa6a4fa05319f2e49d87031a83459601dbd76f392c04", "ja": "やってみて思ったんですけど……私、韻を踏むことに\n必死になって、フローがおざなりになってませんか？", "zh": "试过之后我觉得……我是不是光顾着押韵，把节奏给忽略了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_03_1021_p", "source_sha256": "9fc28132cde7fbffc52c9ec7c40bd9026aa09d2c4633082798ce26eb66514eac", "ja": "フロー……節回しは確かに重要だな。言葉選びと\n言い方のリズムが、ラップのノリを生むみたいだし。", "zh": "流畅度……押韵固然重要。毕竟，遣词和说话的节奏，似乎才能营造出说唱的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_03_1022_009rit", "source_sha256": "9c01d308467a82780d6d367db0cc4f43c43c73a13a2296ac48c177fc6eb9972a", "ja": "その点は、亜美や真美のほうが上手いっていうか。\n日ごろの積み重ねがあるのかもしれませんね。", "zh": "在这方面，应该说亚美和真美更擅长吧。也许是因为她们平时一直在积累经验。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_03_1023_011ami", "source_sha256": "a51b214e73208a4d870dde945aaec1f22b964dd43709807787882bef6752db92", "ja": "んっふっふ～♪　ほめられちった？\nあーああ～、マイクチェック、1,2♪", "zh": "嗯哼哼～♪　这是在夸亚美吗？\n啊～啊～，试音，1，2♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_03_1024_p", "source_sha256": "bae072a39bffd506f05101f1cec55ddbabc1281b2a80cd94bf27176ed27eaca5", "ja": "ただ、亜美と真美はノリがいい代わりに、\n何を言ってるのかわかりにくいところもあるな。", "zh": "不过，亚美和真美虽然很会活跃气氛，但有时候也让人听不懂她们在说什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_03_1025_012mam", "source_sha256": "9d03a8fd305dad5948aacec6089586fc5bfcf07bce52bd91efa5595479a134c4", "ja": "えっ！　そうだったの……兄ちゃんと真美の心は\n通じ合ってるって、今までずっと思ってたんだけど。", "zh": "诶！原来是这样啊……我一直以为哥哥和真美的心意是相通的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_03_1026_011ami", "source_sha256": "18822f1ad1b7cb3bac5d0d857c638562a3410fca0aad8e8957e7c12ec92c105a", "ja": "さりげなく大ショックな発言だよ、兄ちゃん……。", "zh": "哥哥，你这句话看似不经意，其实给了我好大的打击……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_03_1027_p", "source_sha256": "d4fb386ffa6363c3998a2d41a5bc86145eef203184eea76d6973c74b07fcb933", "ja": "ああ、すまない！\nけど今のは、あくまでも今のラップでの話だからな？", "zh": "啊，抱歉！\n不过刚才说的，只是针对刚才那段说唱而言哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_03_1028_p", "source_sha256": "3c765dc5632d8004cd5e700fd98b6b5685669bde0808f6e4243dda07e2fd51f8", "ja": "3人とも、休憩がてら、少し散歩に行かないか？\n外に出ていい風に当たれば、気分も変わるだろうし。", "zh": "你们3个，要不要顺便休息一下，去散散步？\n到外面吹吹风，心情应该也会有所转变的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_03_1029_009rit", "source_sha256": "bee8653f095528570659d4ac6565aeadb9fb19a4116dee5e7d2e39ffdfb0b2b6", "ja": "そうですね、すこし酸素が足りないかも……。\nみんなで行きましょうか！", "zh": "是啊，可能有点缺氧了……  \n大家一起去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_03_1030_p", "source_sha256": "4466cdf0af90e007d9cd91e63ec1bf73ea8cc24fe4f0e0069d0fda1469f1eb7e", "ja": "（散歩しようと外に出ると、ロコと歩がいた。\nオープニングアクトの準備中みたいだな）", "zh": "（出来散步时，遇到了ROCO和步。看来她们正在准备开场表演。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_03_1031_011ami", "source_sha256": "6297e70638e5727dae1468ac71f39526d41317e1a4dce854bfb9429dbb6d34b1", "ja": "あ、ロコロコとあゆあゆだ。", "zh": "啊，是ROCOROCO和步步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_03_1032_012mam", "source_sha256": "ba32ed381161d08a0cb42a3df274680c26d0217cb1ddd50aaf3537c1c6b0b997", "ja": "本当だ。何してんだろ？\nお～い、ロコロコ、あゆあゆ～！", "zh": "真的耶，她们在做什么呢？\n喂——ROCOROCO、步步——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_03_1033_025roc", "source_sha256": "cc65183c220d31c5b5d9f6c380de145c77b43a2d1e1b03122321ce8a0faaf5d4", "ja": "あれ……みんな揃って、お出かけですか？\nもしかして、トレーニング？", "zh": "咦……大家都到齐了，是要出门吗？\n难道是在训练？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_03_1034_p", "source_sha256": "5416888723b7274fa972f9dca5acd21328bcfa069e1ee9314dbe9413c678114b", "ja": "いや、休憩だよ。ふたりは、\nオープニングアクトの準備中か？", "zh": "没有，只是休息一下。你们两个是在准备开场表演吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
